## What is GUTS IAM?

GUTS IAM (Identity and Access Management) is a centralized security platform that handles who you are, what you can do, and what you absolutely cannot touch.

It manages identities, authentication, authorization, roles, and permissions across applications — basically acting like the strict gatekeeper who checks your ID twice and still asks, “Are you really supposed to be here?”

Built on a Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) model, the system ensures that access is structured, predictable, and not based on vibes or guesswork.

In short, GUTS IAM keeps things secure, organized, and slightly less chaotic than a group project without a leader.
